        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "34cee5a7-62be-57d0-9be6-0c8089fd51bf",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Thilo Rothkirch, Matthias Lechner, Andrea Romano\n- Films: Laura's Star, Wonder Woman (2009 film), I'm a Fish, Escape from Planet Earth\n- Roles: producer, director, casting director, voice director, voice actress\n- Companies/Franchises: Warner Bros., DC Comics\n\nFacts:\n- Laura's Star is a 2004 German animated feature film.\n- Thilo Rothkirch produced and directed Laura's Star.\n- Wonder Woman is a 2009 direct-to-DVD animated superhero film about the superheroine Wonder Woman.\n- Matthias Lechner's film work includes I'm a Fish, Escape from Planet Earth, and Laura's Star.\n- Andrea Romano was born on December 3, 1955, and she is an American casting director, voice director, and voice actress.\n- Andrea Romano's work includes Tiny Toon Adventures, Animaniacs, Freakazoid, Pinky and the Brain, Teen Titans, The Legend of Korra, Static Shock, Justice League, Justice League Unlimited, Batman Beyond, and Phineas and Ferb.\n- Andrea Romano also worked on multiple Warner Bros. Animation and DC Comics direct-to-video films, including Wonder Woman.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "fd787453-c357-572a-89d1-97309b21fba3",
        "text": "Page: Laura's Star. Sentence: Laura's Star (German: Lauras Stern ) is a 2004 German animated feature film produced and directed by Thilo Rothkirch.\nPage: Wonder Woman (2009 film). Sentence: Wonder Woman is a 2009 direct-to-DVD animated superhero film focusing on the superheroine of the same name.\nPage: Matthias Lechner. Sentence: I'm a Fish and Escape from Planet Earth, as well as Laura's Star, among other films.\nPage: Andrea Romano. Sentence: Andrea Romano (born December 3, 1955) is an American casting director, voice director, and voice actress whose work includes \"\", \"Tiny Toon Adventures\", \"Animaniacs\", \"Freakazoid\", \"Pinky and the Brain\", \"Teen Titans\", \"\", \"The Legend of Korra\", \"Static Shock\", \"Justice League\", \"Justice League Unlimited\", \"Batman Beyond\", \"Phineas and Ferb\" and multiple Warner Bros.\nPage: Andrea Romano. Sentence: Animation/DC Comics direct-to-video films including: \"Wonder Woman\" and \"\".",
